diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 02dc760..0d85c1b 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -1,5 +1,21 @@
 # Changelog
 
+## Unreleased
+
+- Renewal dates are always worked out from the anchor, so a 31st anchor returns
+  to the 31st after a short month, and February in a leap year is no longer
+  treated as 28 days.
+- Proration counts the change date as time left on the new plan, as documented.
+- Amounts, plan prices and statements use each currency's own number of decimals
+  (JPY 0, KWD 3) instead of always two.
+- `allocate` follows the documented largest-remainder rule; a discount can no
+  longer push a free line negative or overload the last line.
+- Line tax within a rate group now adds up exactly to the group's tax, so line
+  gross amounts add up to the invoice total.
+- Credit notes are capped at each line's net (after discount), and take tax from
+  the tax charged on the line, so staged refunds end on a zero balance.
+- `docs/rounding.md` now describes the half-even default.
+
 ## 0.6.2
 
 - Statements show the discount as a negative amount.
